          "heading": "Fijisun reports White in contention for Flying Fijians head coach role",
          "body": "Fijisun has reported that White is in contention for the Flying Fijians coaching role, while Planet Rugby reported earlier this month that an ex-Springboks boss was the favourite to land the job ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup. Fiji have been looking for a successor since Mick Byrne left by mutual agreement on 1 April, and no appointment has been reported in coverage up to today. The next Test is France in Round 4, with the appointment still open."
