          "heading": "PREM: England winger Immanuel Feyi-Waboso awaits hamstring scan after Exeter win",
          "body": "In the PREM, England winger Immanuel Feyi-Waboso awaits scans on a possible hamstring injury after leaving Exeter's 34-28 win over Newcastle Red Bulls on Sunday 11 October early in the second half. Exeter director of rugby Rob Baxter said the winger \"just doesn’t feel right\", adding that it was not \"catastrophic\". Exeter open their Investec Champions Cup campaign at Toulouse, and Feyi-Waboso has already missed time this year, including the 2026 Six Nations."
