          "kicker": "Club injury blow",
          "heading": "Stade Français hooker Lucas Peyresblanques fractures fibula in Top 14 win",
          "body": "Stade Français, the Top 14 club, face their opening Investec Champions Cup match against the Bulls at Loftus Versfeld with three injury setbacks. The most serious is hooker Lucas Peyresblanques, who fractured his fibula in the 30-22 win over Montpellier and underwent surgery on Sunday. Coach Paul Gustard said: \"We risk losing him for five to six months.\" No. 8 Yoan Tanga left after nine minutes with a rib injury, and centre Noah Nene, who hurt his right ankle, could be sidelined for around two weeks."
