          "body": "No development has been reported since the Guardian reported on 10 October that rugby's brain injury claimants face a £2.8m legal bill to continue their case. The claim carries a £2.8m funding deadline, and no revised timetable, settlement or stay of proceedings has been reported since. Today's coverage carries nothing further on the case against the rugby governing bodies, so the last confirmed position is the 10 October report."
